{"id":"n59344-2-5","stage":2,"title":"봉지 · 袋","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n59344-2-5-1","ko":"라면이 얼마나 남았니?","zh":"拉面还剩下多少？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"라면이","meaning":"方便面","explanation":"라면：方便面；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"라면","audio":"/audio/6454befbdb61c843cbd2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62270","senseId":"1","lemma":"라면","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"얼마나","meaning":"多少","explanation":"얼마：多少；나：表示不止预期的数量、举例或退而求其次等，需结合整句语气。","readings":[{"term":"얼마","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29750","senseId":"1","lemma":"얼마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"남았니?","meaning":"剩，剩下","explanation":"남다：剩，剩下；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"남다","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64552","senseId":"1","lemma":"남다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6454befbdb61c843","term":"라면","zh":"方便面","audio":"/audio/6454befbdb61c843cbd2.mp3","entryId":"62270","definition":"装有油炸干面和粉末状调味料，经水一煮即可方便食用的食物。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"8e0a4529e0c9d4ed","term":"얼마","zh":"多少","audio":"/audio/8e0a4529e0c9d4ed9058.mp3","entryId":"29750","definition":"不知道的数量、价值、程度。","pronunciation":["얼마"]},{"id":"10946131f919fe80","term":"남다","zh":"剩，剩下","audio":"/audio/10946131f919fe8058dd.mp3","entryId":"64552","definition":"没用完，留下了一部分。","pronunciation":["남ː따"]}],"audio":"/audio/7de78a2eafe369804977.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n59344-2-5-2","ko":"이제 세 봉지 남았어요.","zh":"现在还剩下三袋哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이제","meaning":"现在","explanation":"이제：现在","readings":[{"term":"이제","audio":"/audio/16ebe2403bccd648e89e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58621","senseId":"1","lemma":"이제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"세","meaning":"三","explanation":"세：三","readings":[{"term":"세","audio":"/audio/1bcc05bddb3c9e8c0bec.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17194","sen